  steps:
  - colliderTrigger: {fileID: 1612775577}
    disponibleForms: 00000000
    isTutoEnd: 0
    activeTutoUi: 0
    setForm: 0
    form: 0
    asDialogue: 1
    dialogueFR: "Oh qu\u2019est ce que tu fous ! <b>R\xE9veille toi !</b> Tu viens
      \xE0 peine de reprendre et tu glandes d\xE9j\xE0\u2026"
    dialogueEN: "Oh what the hell are you doing! <b>Wake up!</b> You just started
      over and you\u2019re already chilling..."
    setNumberOfPointsForErased: 0
    changeIndicator: 1
    ativeAtk: 1
    numberOfPointsForErased: 0
    hadUI: 1
    temporateUI: 0
    timeOfUI: 5
    uiObject: {fileID: 1768870673}
  - colliderTrigger: {fileID: 1700577933}
    disponibleForms: 00000000
    isTutoEnd: 0
    activeTutoUi: 0
    setForm: 0
    form: 0
    asDialogue: 1
    dialogueFR: "Fais comme d'habitude, <b>nettoie </b>ce r\xEAve et <b>r\xE9cup\xE8re</b>
      ce foutu noyau. Je te surveille."
    dialogueEN: "Do as usual, <b>clean up</b> this dream and <b>get</b> this damn
      core. I\u2019m watching you."
    setNumberOfPointsForErased: 0
    changeIndicator: 0
    ativeAtk: 0
    numberOfPointsForErased: 0
    hadUI: 0
    temporateUI: 0
    timeOfUI: 0
    uiObject: {fileID: 0}
  - colliderTrigger: {fileID: 977070194}
    disponibleForms: 00000000
    isTutoEnd: 0
    activeTutoUi: 5
    setForm: 0
    form: 1
    asDialogue: 0
    dialogueFR: 
    dialogueEN: 
    setNumberOfPointsForErased: 0
    changeIndicator: 0
    ativeAtk: 4
    numberOfPointsForErased: 0
    hadUI: 1
    temporateUI: 0
    timeOfUI: 0
    uiObject: {fileID: 1316928781}
  - colliderTrigger: {fileID: 261345079}
    disponibleForms: 00000000
    isTutoEnd: 0
    activeTutoUi: 2
    setForm: 0
    form: 0
    asDialogue: 1
    dialogueFR: "Je te rappelle que tu as un quota \xE0 remplir, alors <b><color=#FF0000>nettoie
      </color></b>ces <b><color=#FF0000>tas de poussi\xE8res </color></b>!"
    dialogueEN: I remind you that you must hit your quota, so <b><color=#FF0000>clean
      up</color></b> these <b><color=#FF0000>piles of dust</color></b>!
    setNumberOfPointsForErased: 0
    changeIndicator: 0
    ativeAtk: 0
    numberOfPointsForErased: 0
    hadUI: 1
    temporateUI: 0
    timeOfUI: 0
    uiObject: {fileID: 1501724258}
  - colliderTrigger: {fileID: 662206931}
    disponibleForms: 00000000
    isTutoEnd: 0
    activeTutoUi: 7
    setForm: 0
    form: 0
    asDialogue: 1
    dialogueFR: "Pense bien \xE0 <b><color=#FF0000>v\xE9rifier ton t\xE9l\xE9phone
      </color></b>pour voir o\xF9 tu en es au niveau de ton <b><color=#FF0000>quota</color></b>."
    dialogueEN: "Make sure to <b><color=#FF0000>check your phone </color></b>to see
      how you\u2019re doing with your <b><color=#FF0000>quota</color></b>."
    setNumberOfPointsForErased: 0
    changeIndicator: 0
    ativeAtk: 0
    numberOfPointsForErased: 0
    hadUI: 1
    temporateUI: 0
    timeOfUI: 0
    uiObject: {fileID: 2104164556}
  - colliderTrigger: {fileID: 1141386771}
    disponibleForms: 00000000
    isTutoEnd: 0
    activeTutoUi: 0
    setForm: 0
    form: 0
    asDialogue: 1
    dialogueFR: "C\u2019est nous qui te donnons acc\xE8s \xE0 ta <b><color=#FF0000>puissance
      de cr\xE9ation</color></b>, alors fais bien ton taff pour <b><color=#FF0000>acc\xE9der
      \xE0 la suite du r\xEAve</color></b> !"
    dialogueEN: We are the ones who give you access to your <b><color=#FF0000>creation
      power</color></b>, so make sure you're doing your job well to <b><color=#FF0000>access
      the rest of the dream</color></b>!
    setNumberOfPointsForErased: 0
    changeIndicator: 0
    ativeAtk: 0
    numberOfPointsForErased: 0
    hadUI: 0
    temporateUI: 0
    timeOfUI: 0
    uiObject: {fileID: 0}
  - colliderTrigger: {fileID: 439222631}
    disponibleForms: 00000000
    isTutoEnd: 0
    activeTutoUi: 0
    setForm: 0
    form: 0
    asDialogue: 1
    dialogueFR: "Tiens, j\u2019esp\xE8re que tu ne les as pas oubli\xE9s, eux, <b><color=#FF0000>\r\nnettoie</color></b>
      ce Zonyr qui d\xE9gueulasse le r\xEAve."
    dialogueEN: "Well, I hope you haven\u2019t forgotten them, <b><color=#FF0000>\r\nclean
      up</color></b> this Zonyr who makes the dream dirty."
    setNumberOfPointsForErased: 0
    changeIndicator: 0
    ativeAtk: 0
    numberOfPointsForErased: 0
    hadUI: 0
    temporateUI: 0
    timeOfUI: 0
    uiObject: {fileID: 0}
  - colliderTrigger: {fileID: 1305260524}
    disponibleForms: 00000000
    isTutoEnd: 0
    activeTutoUi: 1
    setForm: 0
    form: 0
    asDialogue: 1
    dialogueFR: "T\u2019es d\xE9j\xE0 bless\xE9 ? Bah, sers-toi de ces poussi\xE8res
      \xE9tincelantes pour te <b><color=#FF0000>\r\nsoigner</color></b>. \r\n<b><color=#FF0000>(MAINTENIR
      A)</color></b>"
    dialogueEN: "Already injured? Well, use this sparkling dust to <b><color=#FF0000>\r\nheal
      yourself</color></b>. \r\n<b><color=#FF0000>(MAINTAIN A)</color></b>"
    setNumberOfPointsForErased: 0
    changeIndicator: 1
    ativeAtk: 2
    numberOfPointsForErased: 0
    hadUI: 1
    temporateUI: 0
    timeOfUI: 0
    uiObject: {fileID: 1608075721}
  - colliderTrigger: {fileID: 1589093519}
    disponibleForms: 00000000
    isTutoEnd: 0
    activeTutoUi: 6
    setForm: 0
    form: 0
    asDialogue: 1
    dialogueFR: "Si tu <b><color=#FF0000>effaces</color></b> les \xE9l\xE9ments que
      tu as cr\xE9\xE9s, tu peux <b><color=#FF0000>\r\nr\xE9cup\xE9rer</color></b>
      ta <b><color=#FF0000>puissance de cr\xE9ation</color></b>."
    dialogueEN: 'If you <b><color=#FF0000>erase</color></b> the elements you created,
      you can <b><color=#FF0000>

      recover</color></b> your <b><color=#FF0000>creation
      power</color></b>.'
    setNumberOfPointsForErased: 0
    changeIndicator: 0
    ativeAtk: 0
    numberOfPointsForErased: 0
    hadUI: 0
    temporateUI: 0
    timeOfUI: 0
    uiObject: {fileID: 0}
  - colliderTrigger: {fileID: 631205111}
    disponibleForms: 00000000
    isTutoEnd: 0
    activeTutoUi: 0
    setForm: 0
    form: 0
    asDialogue: 1
    dialogueFR: "Tu peux aussi <b><color=#FF0000>effacer tout les \xE9l\xE9ments</color></b>
      que tu as cr\xE9er en te concentrant.\r\n<b><color=#FF0000>(MAINTENIR R1)</color></b>"
    dialogueEN: 'You can also <b><color=#FF0000>erase all the elements</color></b>
      you have created by concentrating.

      <b><color=#FF0000>(MAINTAIN R1)</color></b>'
    setNumberOfPointsForErased: 0
    changeIndicator: 0
    ativeAtk: 0
    numberOfPointsForErased: 0
    hadUI: 0
    temporateUI: 0
    timeOfUI: 0
    uiObject: {fileID: 0}
  - colliderTrigger: {fileID: 893158800}
    disponibleForms: 02000000
    isTutoEnd: 0
    activeTutoUi: 3
    setForm: 1
    form: 2
    asDialogue: 1
    dialogueFR: Bon, maintenant on va revoir ensemble la <b><color=#FF0000>forme
      cauchemar</color></b>.
    dialogueEN: "Well, now we\u2019re going to check the <b><color=#FF0000>nightmare
      form</color></b> together."
    setNumberOfPointsForErased: 0
    changeIndicator: 1
    ativeAtk: 3
    numberOfPointsForErased: 0
    hadUI: 1
    temporateUI: 0
    timeOfUI: 0
    uiObject: {fileID: 1847948337}
  - colliderTrigger: {fileID: 1976847404}
    disponibleForms: 02000000
    isTutoEnd: 0
    activeTutoUi: 6
    setForm: 0
    form: 2
    asDialogue: 1
    dialogueFR: "Aaaah, les peluches\u2026 Si jamais elles sont trop loin, tu peux
      les <b><color=#FF0000>tirer vers toi</color></b> et les <b><color=#FF0000>avaler</color></b>
      pour les <b><color=#FF0000>poser autre part</color></b>."
    dialogueEN: "Aaaah, those plushies... If they\u2019re ever too far away, you
      can <b><color=#FF0000>pull them towards you</color></b> and <b><color=#FF0000>swallow</color></b>
      them to <b><color=#FF0000>put them somewhere else</color></b>."
    setNumberOfPointsForErased: 0
    changeIndicator: 1
    ativeAtk: 3
    numberOfPointsForErased: 0
    hadUI: 1
    temporateUI: 0
    timeOfUI: 0
    uiObject: {fileID: 300991356}
  - colliderTrigger: {fileID: 2109056450}
    disponibleForms: 000000000200000001000000
    isTutoEnd: 0
    activeTutoUi: 0
    setForm: 1
    form: 0
    asDialogue: 1
    dialogueFR: "Allez j\u2019suis gentil, je te laisse acc\xE9der \xE0 <b><color=#FF0000>toutes
      tes formes</color></b>, maintenant fais ton boulot."
    dialogueEN: Consider me generous, I am granting you access to <b><color=#FF0000>all
      your forms</color></b>. Now, do your job.
    setNumberOfPointsForErased: 0
    changeIndicator: 1
    ativeAtk: 5
    numberOfPointsForErased: 0
    hadUI: 1
    temporateUI: 0
